<title>UK: Baronsmead to raise 15 mln stg via shares.</title>
<headline>Baronsmead to raise 15 mln stg via shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK investment trust Baronsmead VCT said on Thursday it planned to raise up to 15 million pounds via an offer of new ordinary shares to allow the company to broaden the spread of its investments.  </p>
<p>The pricing of the proposed offer, which is subject to shareholder approval, has not yet been finalised.</p>
<p>But the investment trust said it would ensure that there was no dilution of net asset value for existing shareholders.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
